{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOToolBarBottom","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"toolBarBottom"},{"text":" View helper applies a SwiftUI toolbar configuration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Platform considerations","anchor":"Platform-considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not available on watchOS, tvOS and macOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Guidelines","text":"Guidelines"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Test the use of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"toolBarBottom"},{"text":" for both iOS with Liquid Glass and not Liquid Glass","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use both an  ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTabBar","type":"reference"},{"text":" with the ","type":"text"},{"code":"toolBarBottom","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the toolbar will be above the tabbar for iOS lower than 26, ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not recommended"}],"type":"strong"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use both an  ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTabBar"},{"text":" with the ","type":"text"},{"code":"toolBarBottom","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the toolbar will be ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"behind","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the tabbar for iOS 26+, so not usable, ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not recommended","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Avoid use of both ","type":"text"},{"code":"toolBarBottom","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTabBar","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in the same page"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Badges-uses","type":"heading","text":"Badges uses"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the system does not render system badge for items in bottom toolbar, the MISO badge component is used for iOS 26 with Liquid Glass and bottom toolbars."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However the glassified effect of Liquid Glass does not make sometimes the badge readable, that is the reason why you should use badge for bottom toolbars with lots of care"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and prefer "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"prominent","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tinted"}]},{"type":"text","text":" styles for the item with the badge instead of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass the MISO badge components are always used.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","text":"Code samples"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Define leading and trailing items for the bottom toolbar","type":"text"}]},{"code":["    SomeView()","        .toolBarBottom(leadingIt